          "id": "step-2-1",
          "claim": "The constrained data in step 1.1 meet the exact smooth connected data\nhypotheses of [F6], with precisely its Countable Choice and Dependent Choice\nassumptions [F10]. Applying [F6] gives a smooth globally hyperbolic maximal\nfield-strength development $M_{\\max}$, universal for all smooth globally\nhyperbolic field-strength developments of these data and unique up to the\nstated data-fixing isometry. This constructs the field-strength development;\nits fixed-bundle connection realization is proved next.",
          "step": "2.1",
